<title>JAPAN: Benchmark cash JGB yield falls to 2.145 percent.</title>
<headline>Benchmark cash JGB yield falls to 2.145 percent.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese government bonds (JGBs) continued to rally in the afternoon Tokyo session on Tuesday, with the yield of the benchmark cash 182nd JGB falling to a record low of 2.145 percent.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-9780</p>
